"c-shiji-041-yue"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-041-yue:p001","quote":"越王句踐，其先禹之苗裔，而夏后帝少康之庶子也。封於會稽，以奉守禹之祀。文身斷髮，披草萊而邑焉。後二十餘世，至於允常。允常之時，與呉王闔廬戰而相怨伐。允常卒，子句踐立，是爲越王。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-041-yue:p002","quote":"元年，呉王闔廬聞允常死，乃興師伐越。越王句踐使死士挑戰，三行，至呉陳，呼而自剄。呉師觀之，越因襲撃呉師，呉師敗於檇李，射傷呉王闔廬。闔廬且死，告其子夫差曰：「必毋忘越。」"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-041-yue:p029","quote":"越祖少康，至於允常。其子始霸，與呉爭彊。槜李之役，闔閭見傷。會稽之恥，勾踐欲當。種誘以利，蠡悉其良。折節下士，致膽思嘗。卒複讎寇，遂殄大邦。後不量力，滅於無彊。"}],"rationale":"限本篇明示姓名、短稱與同一事件角色；范蠡自謂鴟夷子皮、陶朱公按明文相接。跨篇僅使用另存同指決定，不按同名合併；匿名楚王不套用楚威王，未知諸子姓名不補。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:p001","text":"越王句踐，其先禹之苗裔，而夏后帝少康之庶子也。封於會稽，以奉守禹之祀。文身斷髮，披草萊而邑焉。後二十餘世，至於允常。允常之時，與呉王闔廬戰而相怨伐。允常卒，子句踐立，是爲越王。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m001-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"越王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002055","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m001-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"句踐","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002055","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m001-0007","start":7,"end":8,"surface":"禹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002056","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m001-0013","start":13,"end":18,"surface":"夏后帝少康","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002057","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m001-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"庶子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名、群體、神祇或引語用稱待覆核；不補姓名與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m001-0031","start":31,"end":32,"surface":"禹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002056","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m001-0055","start":55,"end":57,"surface":"允常","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002058","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m001-0058","start":58,"end":60,"surface":"允常","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002058","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m001-0064","start":64,"end":68,"surface":"呉王闔廬","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002059","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m001-0074","start":74,"end":76,"surface":"允常","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002058","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m001-0079","start":79,"end":81,"surface":"句踐","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002055","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m001-0085","start":85,"end":87,"surface":"越王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002055","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-041-yue","book_id":"b-shiji-041","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-041-yue"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:p002","text":"元年，呉王闔廬聞允常死，乃興師伐越。越王句踐使死士挑戰，三行，至呉陳，呼而自剄。呉師觀之，越因襲撃呉師，呉師敗於檇李，射傷呉王闔廬。闔廬且死，告其子夫差曰：「必毋忘越。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m002-0003","start":3,"end":7,"surface":"呉王闔廬","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002059","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m002-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"允常","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002058","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m002-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"越王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002055","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m002-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"句踐","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002055","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m002-0061","start":61,"end":65,"surface":"呉王闔廬","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002059","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m002-0066","start":66,"end":68,"surface":"闔廬","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002059","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m002-0074","start":74,"end":76,"surface":"夫差","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002060","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-041-yue","book_id":"b-shiji-041","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-041-yue"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:p029","text":"越祖少康，至於允常。其子始霸，與呉爭彊。槜李之役，闔閭見傷。會稽之恥，勾踐欲當。種誘以利，蠡悉其良。折節下士，致膽思嘗。卒複讎寇，遂殄大邦。後不量力，滅於無彊。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"witness_appended_suoyin_zan","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m029-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"少康","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002057","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m029-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"允常","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002058","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m029-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"其子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名、群體、泛稱或未定指代保留；不補名字、世代與個人成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m029-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"闔閭","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002059","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m029-0035","start":35,"end":37,"surface":"勾踐","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002055","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m029-0040","start":40,"end":41,"surface":"種","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002062","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m029-0045","start":45,"end":46,"surface":"蠡","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002061","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m029-0077","start":77,"end":79,"surface":"無彊","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002080","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-041-yue","book_id":"b-shiji-041","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-041-yue"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-041-yue","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-041","source_id":"s-shiji-041-yue","source":{"title":"史記／卷041","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷041","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷041&oldid=2018395","revision_id":2018395,"accessed_on":"2026-10-09","extent":"28段正文及1段分層索隱述贊；排除2個dd導覽，去除段落外緣空白。","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文；數位轉錄依維基文庫CC BY-SA 4.0，保留署名及固定版本。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","normalization":{"character_conversion":{"笔":"筆"},"editorial_readings":[],"extraction_note":"固定修訂與取得時HTML一致，僅去除段落外緣空白；第17段笔轉筆，不自行校讀盡取筆呉地。保留句踐／勾踐、闔廬／闔閭及呉等古代異體。","note":"全29段數位正文已閱讀；未核古籍影像、可靠底本及現代研究。"}}}],"time_policy":{"unknown_is_not_unbounded":true,"attestation_is_not_tenure":true,"date_expressions_are_not_normalized":false,"date_normalization_coverage":"partial","normalized_year_numbering":"astronomical"}}
